<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Profit Pulse – Trade Smarter. Profit Faster.</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Inter:400,700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: 'Inter', Arial, sans-serif;
      margin: 0;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f2027, #2c5364 80%);
      color: #fff;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: auto;
      padding: 40px 16px;
    }
    header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding-bottom: 32px;
    }
    .logo {
      font-size: 2.2rem;
      font-weight: bold;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      color: #34e3a5;
    }
    nav a {
      color: #fff;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin-left: 24px;
      font-weight: 500;
      transition: color 0.2s;
    }
    nav a:hover {
      color: #34e3a5;
    }
    .hero {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 40px;
      margin-bottom: 60px;
    }
    .hero-content {
      flex: 1 1 400px;
    }
    .hero-content h1 {
      font-size: 3rem;
      margin: 0 0 16px 0;
      color: #34e3a5;
    }
    .hero-content p {
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      color: #ddeef5;
    }
    .cta-btn {
      background: linear-gradient(90deg,#34e3a5,#49c6e5);
      color: #0f2027;
      border: none;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      font-weight: bold;
      padding: 16px 32px;
      border-radius: 40px;
      cursor: pointer;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(52,227,165, 0.15);
      transition: background 0.2s;
    }
    .cta-btn:hover {
      background: linear-gradient(90deg,#49c6e5,#34e3a5);
    }
    .hero-image {
      flex: 1 1 350px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .hero-image img {
      max-width: 360px;
      width: 100%;
      border-radius: 24px;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
      border: 2px solid #34e3a5;
      background: #fff;
    }
    .features {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));
      gap: 32px;
      margin-bottom: 60px;
    }
    .feature-card {
      background: rgba(44,83,100,0.92);
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 28px 20px;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(34,227,165,0.08);
    }
    .feature-icon {
      font-size: 2.4rem;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      color: #49c6e5;
    }
    .feature-title {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      font-weight: bold;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      color: #34e3a5;
    }
    .feature-desc {
      font-size: 1rem;
      color: #ddeef5;
    }
    .waitlist {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 60px;
    }
    .waitlist input[type="email"] {
      padding: 12px 18px;
      border-radius: 30px;
      border: none;
      font-size: 1rem;
      margin-right: 8px;
      outline: none;
      width: 260px;
    }
    .waitlist button {
      background: linear-gradient(90deg,#34e3a5,#49c6e5);
      color: #0f2027;
      border: none;
      padding: 12px 30px;
      border-radius: 30px;
      font-weight: bold;
      font-size: 1rem;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: background 0.2s;
    }
    .waitlist button:hover {
      background: linear-gradient(90deg,#49c6e5,#34e3a5);
    }
    footer {
      text-align: center;
      color: #ddeef5;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      padding: 32px 8px 16px 8px;
      margin-top: 40px;
      border-top: 1px solid #23405a;
    }
    .social-links a {
      color: #49c6e5;
      margin: 0 10px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      vertical-align: middle;
    }
    @media (max-width: 750px) {
      .hero {
        flex-direction: column-reverse;
        gap: 24px;
      }
      .hero-content h1 {
        font-size: 2.2rem;
      }
      .hero-image img {
        max-width: 260px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <header>
      <div class="logo">Profit Pulse</div>
      <nav>
        <a href="#features">Features</a>
        <a href="#waitlist">Waitlist</a>
        <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
      </nav>
    </header>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-content">
        <h1>Trade Smarter.<br>Profit Faster.</h1>
        <p>
          AI-powered trading tools, real-time analytics, and multi-broker support. <br>
          Maximize your edge with Profit Pulse—built for modern investors and traders.
        </p>
        <button class="cta-btn">Join the Early Access Waitlist</button>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-image">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1461749280684-dccba630e2f6?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Trading dashboard preview">
        <!-- Replace with your own dashboard mockup or branded illustration -->
      </div>
    </section>
    <section id="features">
      <div class="features">
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">🤖</div>
          <div class="feature-title">AI Trading Engine</div>
          <div class="feature-desc">Adaptive strategies powered by machine learning for stocks, crypto, and more.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">📊</div>
          <div class="feature-title">Real-Time Analytics</div>
          <div class="feature-desc">Beautiful dashboards to track performance, risk, and market trends live.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">🔗</div>
          <div class="feature-title">Multi-Broker Integration</div>
          <div class="feature-desc">Connect to Alpaca, Interactive Brokers, Binance, and more from one platform.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">🔒</div>
          <div class="feature-title">Enterprise Security</div>
          <div class="feature-desc">Privacy-first design and robust protection for your assets and data.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="waitlist" id="waitlist">
      <h2>🚀 Early Access Beta Launch: November 2025</h2>
      <p>Sign up below for exclusive early access, webinars, and launch updates!</p>
      <form>
        <input type="email" placeholder="your@email.com" required>
        <button type="submit">Join Waitlist</button>
      </form>
      <small style="color:#aaa;">We respect your privacy. No spam, ever.</small>
    </section>
    <footer>
      <div class="social-links">
        <a href="https://twitter.com/profitpulseai" target="_blank" title="Twitter">Twitter</a> |
        <a href="https://linkedin.com/company/profitpulse" target="_blank" title="LinkedIn">LinkedIn</a> |
        <a href="https://discord.gg/profitpulse" target="_blank" title="Discord">Discord</a>
      </div>
      <div id="contact" style="margin-top:12px;">
        Contact: <a href="mailto:info@profitpulse.ai" style="color:#34e3a5;text-decoration:none;">info@profitpulse.ai</a>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top:18px;">
        © 2025 Profit Pulse. All rights reserved. |
        <a href="#" style="color:#49c6e5;">Privacy Policy</a> |
        <a href="#" style="color:#49c6e5;">Terms of Service</a>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
